Package: koinos-hwcaps
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libc6-riscv64-cross (>= 2.38), libc6-dev-riscv64-cross
Recommends: koinos-hwcaps-openssl, koinos-hwcaps-libgcrypt, koinos-hwcaps-libjpeg-turbo
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V Hardware Capabilities (hwcaps) support for RVA23U64
 This package provides the glibc-hwcaps directory structure and helper scripts
 for RVA23U64 profile detection on RISC-V hardware.
 .
 It creates the /usr/lib/riscv64-linux-gnu/hwcaps/RVA23U64/ directory
 and installs helper scripts for hwprobe syscall detection and IFUNC
 resolver verification.
 .
 This package is part of the Agile611 Koinos RISC-V RISC-V distribution.

Package: koinos-hwcaps-openssl
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinos-hwcaps, openssl-riscv64-cross
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V hwcaps - OpenSSL optimized for RVA23U64
 This package provides OpenSSL libraries optimized for RVA23U64 profile
 with RVV 1.0 vectorized cryptographic routines.
 .
 The libraries are installed in /usr/lib/riscv64-linux-gnu/hwcaps/RVA23U64/
 and loaded automatically via glibc-hwcaps when hwprobe detects RVA23U64 support.

Package: koinos-hwcaps-libgcrypt
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinos-hwcaps, libgcrypt20-riscv64-cross
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V hwcaps - libgcrypt optimized for RVA23U64
 This package provides libgcrypt libraries optimized for RVA23U64 profile
 with RVV 1.0 vectorized cryptographic routines.

Package: koinos-hwcaps-libjpeg-turbo
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, koinos-hwcaps, libjpeg-turbo-riscv64-cross
Description: Agile611 Koinos RISC-V hwcaps - libjpeg-turbo optimized for RVA23U64
 This package provides libjpeg-turbo libraries optimized for RVA23U64 profile
 with RVV 1.0 vectorized image processing routines.
